            },
            "level": {
                "value": -1
            },
            "privateNotes": "",
            "publicNotes": "<p>Nykteras, or bat sprites, are gentle fey known for their affectionate nature and incredible hospitality. Nykteras share features with bats, but the type of bat varies by location. A nyktera's sense of hospitality is such that they're willing to share with any who need it, even bitter foes. Violating a nyktera's hospitality is one of their greatest taboos, inviting rare anger and retribution from the nyktera who was wronged, as well as their large extended family.</p><hr /><p>Elusive, flighty, and ebullient, sprites are what many villagers first imagine when they hear the terms \"fey\" or \"fairy.\"</p>",
            "publication": {
                "license": "ORC",
                "remaster": true,
                "title": "Pathfinder Feybound"
            }
